==Trivia==
This card is one of several featured in the {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} expansion's "Ecosystem of Stark Mountain" [[Space-Time Smackdown (TCG Pocket)#Themed Collections|Themed Collection]]. All of the featured cards' standard prints are illustrated by [[Oswaldo KATO]] and feature {{p|Heatran}}'s [[footprint]]s in the background; all four Pokémon are also featured in {{TCG ID|Space-Time Smackdown|Heatran|174}}'s illustration rare print. It is implied that all of the illustrations are set in [[Stark Mountain]], where {{p|Heatran}} and {{p|Magcargo}} can be found in {{game|Diamond and Pearl|s|Pokémon Diamond, Pearl}}, {{game|Platinum||Platinum}}, {{game|Brilliant Diamond and Shining Pearl|s|Brilliant Diamond, and Shining Pearl}}.

===Origin===
*'''Searing Flame''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Expedition|Charmander|98}} from the {{TCG|Expedition Base Set}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|X}}.

